#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-options.rst:521
#: 60b28d64f11f46e4a1e6bc8fcae7b527
msgid ""
"Every serial port has in addition, to its baud rate (``SERIALx_BAUD``) and "
"protocol format (``SERIALx_PROTOCOL``), the ability to invert its RX input "
"and/or TX data, operate in half-duplex mode, and/or swap its RX and TX "
"inputs."
msgstr ""
"除波特率（ ``SERIALx_BAUD``）和协议格式（ "
"``SERIALx_PROTOCOL``）外，每个串行端口还能够反转其RX输入和/或TX数据、以半双工模式运行，以及/或交换其RX和TX输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-options.rst:523
#: 76c6d836392843dcbe066376a17ab72a
msgid ""
"For example, for direct connection to FRSky SPort telemetry, normally "
"inverters and diode OR externally would be required. With SERIALx_OPTIONS "
"bitmask set to 7, direct connection to the SPort can be accomplished from a "
"serial port."
msgstr ""
"例如，若要直接连接FRSky "
"SPort数传，通常需要外部反相器和二极管OR电路。将SERIALx_OPTIONS位掩码设置为7，即可从串行端口直接连接到SPort。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-options.rst:526
#: 36388e08ec0c479d990572bd5295c55e
msgid "Bitmask Options"
msgstr "位掩码选项"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-options.rst:528
#: 9b5806bee50d46fc9aa874d4b676d89f
msgid "if bit 0 is set, then RX data received is inverted internally."
msgstr "如果第0位置位，则内部反转接收到的RX数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-options.rst:529
#: f11380a4652841429229e286cde039ce
msgid "if bit 1 is set, the TX data is inverted before outputting."
msgstr "如果第1位置位，则在输出前反转TX数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-options.rst:530
#: c1bbe552eca045ee8f54b32d49dea508
msgid ""
"if bit 2 is set, then HalfDuplex operation using the TX pin is implemented."
msgstr "如果第2位置位，则使用TX引脚实现半双工操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-options.rst:531
#: 5f5bcc1cae7746deb6471039daedb25a
msgid ""
"if bit 3 is set, then the TX and RX pins are effectively swapped internally."
msgstr "如果第3位置位，则内部有效交换TX和RX引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-options.rst:532
#: 1b0a5fd0cf0146ae9943c4c615890612
msgid ""
"if bit 4 is set, then the RX pin has a weak pull down resistor activated."
msgstr "如果第4位置位，则RX引脚激活弱下拉电阻。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-options.rst:533
#: 008ac673650f42f7b0b7c319279c0272
msgid ""
"if bit 5 is set, then the RX pin has a weak pull up resistor activated."
msgstr "如果第5位置位，则RX引脚激活弱上拉电阻。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-options.rst:534
#: b8bc689907d84b229696d9e824f02493
msgid ""
"if bit 6 is set, then the TX pin has a weak pull down resistor activated."
msgstr "如果第6位置位，则TX引脚激活弱下拉电阻。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-options.rst:535
#: 7920e5c022f245999bed82ab407bf1c1
msgid ""
"if bit 7 is set, then the TX pin has a weak pull up resistor activated."
msgstr "如果第7位置位，则TX引脚激活弱上拉电阻。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-options.rst:536
#: 034f758e5ff248a6b9f073345cc0c3a4
msgid ""
"if bit 8 is set, then the RX has no DMA activated (assuming DMA is available"
" on this UART)"
msgstr "如果第8位置位，则RX未激活DMA（假设该UART上DMA可用）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-options.rst:537
#: f7e6f7220d7e4edcba23096c88b59e0e
msgid ""
"if bit 9 is set, then the TX has no DMA activated (assuming DMA is available"
" on this UART)"
msgstr "如果第9位置位，则TX未激活DMA（假设该UART上DMA可用）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-options.rst:538
#: 5ae82ebec5f44e0e9edd7b80890febf0
msgid ""
"if bit 10 is set, then MAVLink forwarding will not be active on this UART "
"port."
msgstr "如果第10位置位，则该UART端口上不会激活MAVLink转发。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-options.rst:539
#: 2584a2bac96543e4833209e9c491482c
msgid "if bit 11 is set, then the hardware FIFO in H7 autopilots is disabled"
msgstr "如果第11位置位，则H7飞控中的硬件FIFO被禁用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-options.rst:540
